      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I get notifications on mobile via the app, so I do have to mute notifications. I'll be at work and get notifications for each group instance that's opening, and just like you, the other night one of the groups I'm in sent out notifications for every performer at their event.\n\nI feel like there's something more that needs to be done about group notification spam, but this is a good place to start.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
