  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-22T23:42:51.352Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "This feature request is to ask for the group notifications to be grouped in some way. Probably by group.\n\nFor example, I logged in today, and after only 1 day, I managed to get 51 group notifications. This is not helped by the fact that many groups will spam 5-10+ notifications in a single night because of events with DJs or whatever.\n\nSo really this is just asking for a refresh of the UI. I don't want to simply mute all these groups that send a lot of notifications. I just think there can be an improvement to the UI to make it easier to see the notifications from each group and not have to scroll through a single, giant list.",
